## How it's organized

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `rules/` | Persistent AI guidance (coding standards, workflow conventions, project info) |
| `skills/` | Task-specific capabilities (Atlassian, b2c CLI, OpenSpec, review, …) |
| `agents/` | Specialized subagents |
| `commands/` | Slash commands (`/project:init`, `/project:sync`, `/opsx:*`, …) |
| `hooks/` | Event-driven automation |
| `.project/` | Init machinery, templates, and per-dev credentials (internal — not for LLM context) |
